From df611c251d1b71c0a48247a75fd815bbd8adeff7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:52:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Lane M item 4: a trade with no plan is still asked about a
 closed side (ADR-330 (2)(b), (33))

PC trade B-P2 (27 Nov): call side closed, no plan, no side_closed row. owner_lister drops a no-plan trade
(ADR-330 (11): nothing of a plan watched) and the side-closed check ran only over that list; the no-plan
lapse (not_monitored) also closed every open row, side_closed included. Now owner_lister hands no-plan trades
to the side-closed check (Listed.side_only, never monitored), and the not_monitored lapse leaves side_closed
rows open (not plan records), so the question is raised once per closure and stays until answered.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QaT8YKLVg4pMA7wLmU5x8o
